{
  "kind": "notifications",
  "$comment": "What the engine tells the player, and how loudly. Functional Specification 19.7 sets the four levels, the immediate-danger list (warp disruption is deferred with electronic warfare) and the rule that ship destruction cannot be hidden. Each trigger names a registered engine operation; the parameters it passes are listed in src/engine/simulation/notifications.ts. 'oncePerSite' raises a notification the first time in each site visit; repeats inside the group window become one entry with a count.",
